            <ArticleTitle>[Involvement of the hepatobiliary system and pancreas in obesity].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>128-133</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.17116/terarkh2017891128-133</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article provides an overview of current views on the involvement of the liver, gallbladder, and pancreas in patients with overweight and obesity. It considers the general issues of the pathogenesis of these conditions, their clinical features and diagnostic methods.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
